    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A supremely located seaside property that stands proudly on a stunning site, with panoramic views across the bay to the world renowned Roundstone Village. Once the Old Schoolhouse of the island, new life has been breathed into this property-the beautiful natural stone walls are still blended seamlessly with the modern renovation, a beautiful marriage of the old and new. Extensive construction work has been carried out to extend and maximise on the incredible location and views. The house is presented unfinished which gives the buyer great scope to put their own stamp on a dream home. \r\n\r\nThe three-bedroom residence sits on a generous site of circa 1.28 acres, with extensive shore frontage- ideal for maritime enthusiasts or sea swimming. One just needs to walk a few feet through their garden before diving into crystal clear water. There is also a large slipway a stone’s throw from the front gate, ideal for launching a boat. A large garage is built to the east of the house.\r\n\r\nOne enters the house into a spacious hallway that leads into a large kitchen/dining space with breath-taking views. A set of double sliding glass doors have transformed almost the entire west facing wall of this room into a panoramic window framing Roundstone Bay, Roundstone Village and Errisbeg Mountain. To the right of this is the central atrium of the house which was once the original school building and is now the proposed living room. The original stone walls remain, along with the original fireplace-a respectful nod to the humble beginnings of this property. A sunroom to west of the sitting room has another set of doors that lead outside. Further accommodation downstairs consists of an ensuite bedroom, utility room and WC. Upstairs comprises of a shower room and a further two bedrooms, one being the master suite with private balcony. Once again, the views are maximised and each window offers another beautiful scene.\r\n\r\n*****360 TOUR***** \r\nhttps://360tours.proper-t-photos.ie/tours/Ku4H8N1Pf \r\n\r\nThis property speaks for itself and is a remarkable opportunity for someone who is looking for a top tier home in Connemara.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nThese particulars are intended to give a fair description of the property only and are in no way guaranteed, nor do they form part of any contract. They are issued on the express condition that all negotiations are conducted through Matt O’Sullivan Ltd. All properties are offered subject to contract and to being unsold."
